  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support our Centre for Disable Children in Mexico</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Around 72% of locals thought to be living below the national poverty line in Mexico means that resources are limited in many communities. Our project is unique as we provide a safe place for children and vulnerable disabled adults to come, maybe people can&apos;t look after disable family members full time as they have to work so our centre we have three small classes of around 8-10 children and our team help them fulfil their day through sensory learning and other activities.</narrative>
  </description>
